BVRRUserNicknamePrefix\">By <\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRUserNickname\"><a onclick=\"var popupWin = parent.window.open(this.href, null, 'resizable=1,status=1,scrollbars=1,width=800,height=600,top=0'); popupWin.focus(); event.preventDefault?event.preventDefault():event.returnValue = false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ReadAllReviews_c6859efc01d6ddc1f4f075f6724f12b8578f27b2cca2cfcc72d8344bbbbf24c7b1ba6be446262025f69c6a51c8030036\" data-bvtrack=\"eName:ProfileLink\" href=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/profiles/1336/c6859efc01d6ddc1f4f075f6724f12b8578f27b2cca2cfcc72d8344bbbbf24c7b1ba6be446262025f69c6a51c8030036/profile.htm\"><span itemprop=\"author\" class=\"BVRRNickname\">Stephen <\/span><\/a><\/span><div class=\"BVRRUserNicknameReadReviewsContainer\"><a onclick=\"var popupWin = parent.window.open(this.href, null, 'resizable=1,status=1,scrollbars=1,width=800,height=600,top=0'); popupWin.focus(); event.preventDefault?event.preventDefault():event.returnValue = false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ReadAllReviews_c6859efc01d6ddc1f4f075f6724f12b8578f27b2cca2cfcc72d8344bbbbf24c7b1ba6be446262025f69c6a51c8030036\" data-bvtrack=\"eName:ProfileLink\" href=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/profiles/1336/c6859efc01d6ddc1f4f075f6724f12b8578f27b2cca2cfcc72d8344bbbbf24c7b1ba6be446262025f69c6a51c8030036/profile.htm\" class=\"BVRRUserProfileImageLink\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/static/1336/more_reviews_icon.gif\" alt=\"\" /><\/a><a onclick=\"var popupWin = parent.window.open(this.href, null, 'resizable=1,status=1,scrollbars=1,width=800,height=600,top=0'); popupWin.focus(); event.preventDefault?event.preventDefault():event.returnValue = false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ReadAllReviews_c6859efc01d6ddc1f4f075f6724f12b8578f27b2cca2cfcc72d8344bbbbf24c7b1ba6be446262025f69c6a51c8030036\" data-bvtrack=\"eName:ProfileLink\" href=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/profiles/1336/c6859efc01d6ddc1f4f075f6724f12b8578f27b2cca2cfcc72d8344bbbbf24c7b1ba6be446262025f69c6a51c8030036/profile.htm\"><\/a><\/div><\/div>\n\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"2 out of 5\" title=\"2 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-45px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">2<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">No directions or screws<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">06/26/2024<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2024-06-26\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText348185710_ld705ytd36am3fwk063e77qa2_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">Not very happy... Delivery came fast but it didn't come with any directions or screws for the handle or the guard for the trimmer so now we are stuck without not being able to use the trimmer, called,emailed and contacted the manufacturer and the<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText348185710_ld705ytd36am3fwk063e77qa2_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview348185710_2paccnyi2wjd05agwwoy1mx4e_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview348185710_2paccnyi2wjd05agwwoy1mx4e_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Not very happy... Delivery came fast but it didn't come with any directions or screws for the handle or the guard for the trimmer so now we are stuck without not being able to use the trimmer, called,emailed and contacted the manufacturer and the company it came from and they never got back with me to see about what to do to get them<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#1